@startuml d3-run-states

!include style.iuml


title Goose Patrol: D3 run states
caption v0.2.0 draft, 17 Oct 2026
[*] --> READY
READY : entry / show start prompt
READY --> PLAYING : start()
PLAYING : do / count down the clock
PLAYING --> PAUSED : togglePause()
PAUSED : entry / show paused message
PAUSED --> PLAYING : togglePause()
PLAYING --> ENDED : when(timeLeft = 0)
ENDED : entry / show end screen
@enduml